erministic parser reads Facebook’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".origami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","type":"topic","title":"Swami","kind":"symbol","role":"collection"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/searchable(text:placement:prompt:)-7d051":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/searchable(text:placement:prompt:)-7d051","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/searchable(text:placement:prompt:)-7d051","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","title":"searchable(text:placement:prompt:)","abstract":[],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"searchable"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"text","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI7BindingV","text":"Binding","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"placement","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI20SearchFieldPlacementV","text":"SearchFieldPlacement","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"prompt","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"prec